{"sha": "4704e2af4f18845a9c1f75dec31f1c5c334c34f77f84198ba73bc8fa14ba1fe4", "body": ["\\textbf{12.} $\\alpha + \\beta = \\frac{3 + \\iu\\sqrt3 + 3 -", "\\iu\\sqrt3}6 = 1$。于是", "\\[", "\\frac{n_a + n_b + n_c}3", "= \\frac{(\\alpha + \\beta)(a + b + c)}3 = \\frac{a + b + c}3 :", "\\]", "两个三角形有相同的重心。", "", "\\textbf{13.} 按 $\\alpha$ 与 $\\beta$ 分组，并应用第 4 题的", "恒等式于 $P = a + jb + j^2c$：", "\\[", "n_a + j n_b + j^2 n_c", "= \\alpha\\,(b + jc + j^2 a) + \\beta\\,(c + ja + j^2 b)", "= \\alpha\\,j^2 P + \\beta\\,j P", "= (\\alpha j^2 + \\beta j)\\,P .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{14.} 取 $j = \\frac{-1 + \\iu\\sqrt3}2$：", "\\[", "\\alpha j = \\frac{(3 + \\iu\\sqrt3)(-1 + \\iu\\sqrt3)}{12}", "= \\frac{-3 + 3\\iu\\sqrt3 - \\iu\\sqrt3 - 3}{12}", "= \\frac{-3 + \\iu\\sqrt3}6 = -\\beta ,", "\\]", "故 $\\alpha j + \\beta = 0$，从而 $\\alpha j^2 + \\beta j = j(\\alpha j", "+ \\beta) = 0$，由第 13 题得 $n_a + jn_b + j^2n_c = 0$，", "对每个三角形 $(a, b, c)$ 成立。由判别准则（第 4--5 题），", "这些中心构成正向等边三角形，或为单个点：", "拿破仑定理。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 向内的顶点为 $b + \\eu^{+\\iu\\pi/3}(c - b)$，", "并沿用第 11 题的计算，取 $\\eu^{+\\iu\\pi/3} = \\frac{1 +", "\\iu\\sqrt3}2$，则 $\\alpha$ 与 $\\beta$ 互换：$m_a = \\beta b + \\alpha", "c$，$m_b = \\beta c + \\alpha a$，$m_c = \\beta a + \\alpha b$。利用", "类似的恒等式 $b + j^2c + ja = j\\,Q$ 与 $c + j^2a + jb", "= j^2 Q$，其中 $Q = a + j^2b + jc$：", "\\[", "m_a + j^2 m_b + j m_c", "= \\beta(b + j^2 c + ja) + \\alpha(c + j^2 a + jb)", "= (\\beta j + \\alpha j^2)\\, Q = j(\\beta + \\alpha j)\\,Q = 0 ,", "\\]", "由于 $\\alpha j = -\\beta$（第 14 题），因此内侧的中心", "满足 \\emph{反向}等边判别准则，即", "为方向相反的等边三角形（或为一个点）。", "", "\\textbf{16.} 对三元组 $(n_a, n_b, n_c)$ 应用第 5 题，", "（它满足正向判别准则），两个中心重合当且仅当", "三个中心全部重合；而三个中心全部重合当且仅当 \\emph{两个}准则同时成立，", "即另须 $n_a + j^2 n_b + j n_c = 0$。", "仿第 13 题计算，利用恒等式 $b + j^2c + ja = jQ$，$c + j^2a +", "jb = j^2Q$：", "\\[", "n_a + j^2 n_b + j n_c", "= \\alpha\\,jQ + \\beta\\,j^2 Q = j(\\alpha + \\beta j)\\,Q .", "\\]", "直接计算：$\\beta j = \\frac{(3 -", "\\iu\\sqrt3)(-1 + \\iu\\sqrt3)}{12} = \\frac{-3 + 3\\iu\\sqrt3 +", "\\iu\\sqrt3 + 3}{12} = \\frac{\\iu\\sqrt3}3$，故 $\\alpha + \\beta j =", "\\frac{3 + \\iu\\sqrt3 + 2\\iu\\sqrt3}6 = \\frac{1 + \\iu\\sqrt3}2 \\neq", "0$。由此，外侧拿破仑三角形退化当且仅当 $Q = a +", "j^2b + jc = 0$，即 $(a, b, c)$ 为", "反向等边三角形 --- 此时“向外”的作法全都指向", "三角形外接圆所围区域内，并共享同一个中心。", "", "\\textbf{17.} 取 $a = 0$，$b = 1$，$c = \\iu$：", "\\[", "n_a = \\alpha + \\beta\\iu = \\frac{(3 + \\sqrt3)(1 + \\iu)}6,", "\\qquad", "n_b = \\alpha\\iu = \\frac{-\\sqrt3 + 3\\iu}6,", "\\qquad", "n_c = \\beta = \\frac{3 - \\iu\\sqrt3}6 .", "\\]", "边长的平方：$n_a - n_b = \\frac{(3 + 2\\sqrt3) +", "\\iu\\sqrt3}6$，得 $\\abs{n_a - n_b}^2 = \\frac{(3 + 2\\sqrt3)^2 +", "3}{36} = \\frac{24 + 12\\sqrt3}{36} = \\frac{2 + \\sqrt3}3$; $n_b -", "n_c = \\frac{(3 + \\sqrt3)(-1 + \\iu)}6$，得 $\\abs{n_b - n_c}^2 =", "\\frac{2(3 + \\sqrt3)^2}{36} = \\frac{24 + 12\\sqrt3}{36}$; $n_c - n_a", "= \\frac{-\\sqrt3 - \\iu(3 + 2\\sqrt3)}6$ 同样得到相同的值。", "三边长的平方均为 $\\frac{2 + \\sqrt3}3$，故为等边三角形，", "正如所言。", "", "\\textbf{18.} 展开：", "\\[", "(a - b)(c - d) + (a - d)(b - c)", "= (ac - ad - bc + bd) + (ab - ac - bd + cd)", "= ab - ad - bc + cd ,", "\\]", "而 $(a - c)(b - d) = ab - ad - bc + cd$，二者相等。", "", "\\textbf{19.} 对第 18 题两边取模，并应用", "三角不等式（\\cref{prop:b1:complex:rules}~(4)）：", "\\[", "AC \\cdot BD = \\abs{(a-b)(c-d) + (a-d)(b-c)}", "\\leq \\abs{a-b}\\,\\abs{c-d} + \\abs{a-d}\\,\\abs{b-c}", "= AB \\cdot CD + AD \\cdot BC ,", "\\]", "等号成立当且仅当两加项位于从 $0$ 出发的", "同一条射线上（即三角不等式的取等情形）。", "", "\\textbf{20.} 半角因式分解", "（\\cref{met:b1:complex:trig}~(4)）：", "$\\eu^{\\iu\\theta} - \\eu^{\\iu\\varphi} = 2\\iu\\,\\sin\\frac{\\theta -", "\\varphi}2\\;\\eu^{\\iu(\\theta + \\varphi)/2}$，取模即可消去", "单位模因子：$\\abs{\\eu^{\\iu\\theta} - \\eu^{\\iu\\varphi}}", "= 2\\,\\abs{\\sin\\frac{\\theta - \\varphi}2}$.", "", "\\textbf{21.} 取 $p = \\eu^{\\iu\\theta}$，$\\theta \\in", "\\intoo{2\\pi/3}{4\\pi/3}$，由第 20 题得", "\\[", "PA = 2\\,\\abs{\\sin\\tfrac\\theta2},", "\\quad", "PB = 2\\,\\abs{\\sin\\bigl(\\tfrac\\theta2 - \\tfrac\\pi3\\bigr)},", "\\quad", "PC = 2\\,\\abs{\\sin\\bigl(\\tfrac\\theta2 - \\tfrac{2\\pi}3\\bigr)} .", "\\]", "在该弧上，$\\frac\\theta2 \\in \\intoo{\\pi/3}{2\\pi/3}$：于是", "$\\sin\\frac\\theta2 > 0$; $\\frac\\theta2 - \\frac\\pi3 \\in", "\\intoo0{\\pi/3}$，故第二个正弦为正；$\\frac\\theta2 -", "\\frac{2\\pi}3 \\in \\intoo{-\\pi/3}0$，故第三个为负，", "从而 $PC = 2\\sin\\bigl(\\frac{2\\pi}3 - \\frac\\theta2\\bigr)$。和差", "化积：", "\\[", "\\sin\\Bigl(\\frac\\theta2 - \\frac\\pi3\\Bigr) +", "\\sin\\Bigl(\\frac{2\\pi}3 - \\frac\\theta2\\Bigr)", "= 2\\,\\sin\\frac\\pi6\\,\\cos\\Bigl(\\frac\\theta2 - \\frac\\pi2\\Bigr)", "= \\sin\\frac\\theta2 ,", "\\]", "故 $PB + PC = 2\\sin\\frac\\theta2 = PA$：范斯霍滕定理。", ""]}